      "name": "S1 Leaked private key found in a public repository",
      "technique_id": "T1552.004",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--81cb9e9e-e841-5bbe-832c-de01becb99e2",
      "description": "A developer pushes an SSH private key to the datalake-utils repository at 18:50:14 UTC. GitHub secret scanning raises an ssh_private_key alert at 18:52:41. Evidence: github_audit git.push and secret_scanning_alert.create.",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      },
      "effect_refs": [
        "attack-action--cc768766-97a8-524a-8917-8f74ae5ce928"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "attack-action",
      "spec_version": "2.1",
      "id": "attack-action--cc768766-97a8-524a-8917-8f74ae5ce928",
      "created": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "modified": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "name": "S2 SSH login to the dev host with the leaked key",
      "technique_id": "T1021.004",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--b32310c9-a3fd-5eb1-bf63-e1083c96f084",
      "description": "At 18:55:44 a new IP (54.193.215.120) logs in as the developer with the leaked key (publickey authentication), using the account as a valid account. Evidence: linux_auth Accepted publickey, VPC flows to port 22. The account's legitimate sessions, including one ending at 18:52 the same day, all come from 75.125.237.59.",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      },
      "effect_refs": [
        "attack-action--abf29ccf-5e0d-5326-a4c9-1f2991976ce4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "attack-action",
      "spec_version": "2.1",
      "id": "attack-action--abf29ccf-5e0d-5326-a4c9-1f2991976ce4",
      "created": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "modified": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "name": "S3 Host discovery",
      "technique_id": "T1082",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--c1a687db-aaca-5021-89ff-3cbfd7c6bcae",
      "description": "At 18:56:42 the intruder runs id, hostname, uname -a, reads os-release and lists the home directory. Evidence: crowdstrike_fdr ProcessRollup2.",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      },
      "effect_refs": [
        "attack-action--5db319b1-8735-5a44-a1a5-2eaacaf23070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "attack-action",
      "spec_version": "2.1",
      "id": "attack-action--5db319b1-8735-5a44-a1a5-2eaacaf23070",
      "created": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "modified": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "name": "S4 Instance role credentials stolen from IMDSv2",
      "technique_id": "T1552.005",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--7ea45e18-f7cb-5193-969c-adc2e6ced153",
      "description": "At 18:58:12 curl requests an IMDSv2 token and then the instance role credentials from 169.254.169.254. Evidence: crowdstrike_fdr command lines.",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      },
      "effect_refs": [
        "attack-action--a8c16edf-8a24-5b5e-8bfe-19e940bc6ed7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "attack-action",
      "spec_version": "2.1",
      "id": "attack-action--a8c16edf-8a24-5b5e-8bfe-19e940bc6ed7",
      "created": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "modified": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "name": "S5 Cloud identity, IAM and S3 discovery with the stolen role",
      "technique_id": "T1087.004",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--e5bc713d-00e7-5794-8b91-ee6eca1582ad",
      "description": "From 18:59:23 an aws cli unpacked under /var/tmp runs sts get-caller-identity, s3 ls, iam get-role, list-attached-role-policies and list-roles, and is denied ec2 describe-instances. The calls come from the instance public IP 13.57.16.209. Evidence: aws_cloudtrail under the model-dev-05-readonly role, plus matching crowdstrike_fdr commands.",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      },
      "effect_refs": [
        "attack-action--9aca35bd-fe49-546d-b476-80386ac04d22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "attack-action",
      "spec_version": "2.1",
      "id": "attack-action--9aca35bd-fe49-546d-b476-80386ac04d22",
      "created": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "modified": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "name": "S6 Training-data bucket listed and synced to the host",
      "technique_id": "T1530",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--f638b7e9-f48f-59de-84a2-d79023afa089",
      "description": "At 19:02:43 the intruder lists jn-model-training-data-5233, and at 19:04:43 to 19:04:45 runs aws s3 sync into ~/data. That is 65 GetObject calls and about 514 MB of S3 ingress. Evidence: aws_cloudtrail ListObjects and GetObject, aws_vpc_flow from S3 prefixes, crowdstrike_fdr.",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      },
      "effect_refs": [
        "attack-action--d1cf6a28-4b84-5d3b-88a0-ba5245976fb7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "attack-action",
      "spec_version": "2.1",
      "id": "attack-action--d1cf6a28-4b84-5d3b-88a0-ba5245976fb7",
      "created": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "modified": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "name": "S7 Data exfiltrated over SFTP",
      "technique_id": "T1048.002",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--968d443c-a4c1-5e37-afc5-332e96f13ffb",
      "description": "At 19:07:42 a second key login opens an SFTP session that reads 7 files (about 507 MB per sftp-server) at 19:07:43 to 19:07:46. VPC flow shows 526,475,698 bytes out to 54.193.215.120. Evidence: linux_auth sftp-server, aws_vpc_flow.",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      },
      "effect_refs": [
        "attack-action--cf709cf5-e8af-5643-b3e0-4abb6c5b3cc1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "attack-action",
      "spec_version": "2.1",
      "id": "attack-action--cf709cf5-e8af-5643-b3e0-4abb6c5b3cc1",
      "created": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "modified": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
      "name": "S8 Alert resolved without revoking access",
      "technique_id": "T1078",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--e9c51b09-87c0-5bf3-b577-4d650270ec7b",
      "description": "At 19:22:46 the developer resolves the secret-scanning alert, then pushes at 19:42:12 and fetches at 19:46:27. Nothing in the data shows the key being removed from authorized_keys or the role credentials being revoked. Evidence: github_audit.",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      }
    }
